'''Gold Hippoe''' (金カバちゃん, ''Kin Kaba-chan'', '''Gold Hippo-chan''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy introduced in [[GOLD RUSH#The Midas Touch|The Midas Touch]]. It was added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]].

