==Enemy==
Gold Hippoe has a lot of health and does 1,000 damage per hit at 100% magnification. Like the common [[Hippoe]], he moves slowly and is knocked back only when defeated. Sometimes he will freeze Cats in his  range for 3 seconds. He gives a lot of money when killed.

==Strategy==
Gold Hippoe isn't an issue. He has low damage and a lot of health, but should be fairly easy to take down with a basic meatshield + midranger combo. Using someone like [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train]] or [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] is recommended to get even more money from this gilded hippo.

