==Trivia==
*In the [[Media:Eve l 049 en.png|event poster]] for [[GOLD RUSH#The Midas Touch|The Midas Touch]], Gold Hippoe is referred to as Sir Hippoe, which was the only name he had until he was added to the [[Enemy Guide]] in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].
*Gold Hippoe's Japanese name uses 金 ''kin'' (the Japanese word for gold), while [[Golden Doge]]'s uses ゴールデン ''gōruden'' (the English word ''golden'' transliterated into Japanese).

